:"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/milestones/3","html_url":"https://github.com/developing-today/code/milestone/3","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/milestones/3/labels","id":19451723,"node_id":"MI_kwDOJWP4784BKM9L","number":3,"title":"ID platform program","description":"ID platform program - ROLLING milestone. Standing home for the ID engine program (design mill, conversion engine, platform expansion); follow-on ID work keeps landing here indefinitely. Bounded feature waves (e.g. ID Phase 14) get their own milestones under this program.","creator":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":23,"closed_issues":94,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-11-12T06:59:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T02:39:49Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":30,"created_at":"2026-11-05T08:34:12Z","updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:03:37Z","closed_at":"2026-11-14T22:03:31Z","assignee":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"status":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Design amendment candidate for #2054, identified while comparing the governing design with the current implementation for #5525. This issue records unresolved protocol contracts; it does not block PR #6158, which only adds signed GamePost metadata.\n\n## Decisions needed before changing these existing wire contracts\n\n1. **Board ID derivation.** #2054 §1 says derive the stable board ID from (creator signing key, random nonce), but the current ^[[0mBoard.board_id^[[0m is a creator-chosen validated string. Specify the domain separator, nonce bytes/size, derivation and encoding, duplicate behavior, and compatibility for already-published roots.\n2. **Content hashes.** ^[[0mboards::ArtifactHash^[[0m is lower-case SHA-256 and is used by attachments/assets; ^[[0mdocuments::DocumentRef^[[0m / Iroh blobs use BLAKE3 plus length verification, while the merged #2266 PoC package reference uses SHA-256. Specify the hash and size contract per board attachment, theme asset and game package, including verification/migration of existing signed objects.\n3. **Pinned view provenance.** #2054 invariants 97 and 108 require a saved view to identify configuration, frontier and resolution, but current ^[[0mBoardView^[[0m has no provenance fields and the design does not specify their representation. Decide the smallest reproducible view receipt before adding persistence or relying on saved projections.\n\n## Guardrail\nDo not silently change hashes or board IDs in implementation. Either record a design amendment in #2054/doc with explicit compatibility rules, or affirm the existing v1 choices and amend the design to match. Related implementation umbrella: #5525.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] Board ID derivation: the contract is decided and recorded in #2054/doc — domain separator, nonce size/derivation/encoding, duplicate behavior, and compatibility for already-published roots — or the existing creator-chosen validated string is affirmed as v1 and the design amended to match.\n- [ ] Content hashes: the hash + size contract per artifact class (board attachment, theme asset, game package) is decided and recorded, including verification/migration of existing signed objects.\n- [ ] Pinned view provenance: the smallest reproducible view receipt (configuration, frontier, resolution) is specified, or provenance is explicitly deferred with the reason recorded.\n- [ ] No implementation change silently alters board IDs or hashes before these decisions land (guardrail in the body); PR #6158 remains unblocked throughout.\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/developing-today/code/issues/6164/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}